      "extract": "in quantum computation. MerLean extracts mathematical statements from LATEX source files, formalizes them into verified Lean 4 code built on Mathlib, and trans- lates the result back into human-readable LATEX for semantic review. We evaluate MerLean on three theoretical quantum computing papers producing 2,050 Lean dec- larations from 114 statements in total. MerLean achieves end-to-end formalization on all three",
