      "extract": "LLM-based autoformalization and automated theorem provers demonstrated promising capabilities on competition-level problems (Wu et al., 2022; Jiang et al., 2022). Subsequent work improved upon these foundations by addressing proof detail expansion (Tarrach et al., 2024) and faithfulness verification (Li et al., 2024; Liu et al., 2025; Peng et al., 2025). Extensions to domain-specific applications include Euclidean",
      "extractCut": true
